// xtask — 发布归档：各打包命令的 `--archive`（包目录 → 归档）+ `package release`（合并 per-RID 桌面
// workload → SHA256SUMS → release-index.json）。
//
// Release-time packaging glue, shared by release.yml (tagged) + ci.yml
// publish-nightly (rolling). tar / unzip are driven as external subprocesses
// (same as cargo elsewhere); the orchestration logic lives here in z42.
namespace Z42Xtask;

using Std.IO;
using Std.Json;
using Std.Time;

// `package release` 第一步：merge the per-RID desktop-workload pieces (one per desktop RID of versions.toml
// `[rid.*]`, each carries its apphost-<rid>) into ONE RID-agnostic z42-workload-<LABEL>-desktop.tar.gz
// —— 一次下载装齐，任何宿主都能 `publish --rid <其它桌面 target>`。每个 apphost-<rid> 只能在本平台编，
// 零件分散在各台 runner 上，所以合并只能在汇总这一步做。Removes the per-RID intermediates.
int _releaseAssembleDesktop(string label, string dist) {
    Stopwatch sw = _procStart("release assemble-desktop-workload");
    string root = _root();
    string distDir = Path.IsRooted(dist) ? dist : Path.Join(root, dist);

    string work = Path.Join(distDir, ".asm-desktop-work");
    _resetDir(work);
    string merged = Path.Join(work, "z42-workload-" + label + "-desktop");
    Directory.Create(merged);

    string[] rids = _vRidsOfCategory(root, "desktop");
    if (rids.Length == 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("assemble-desktop-workload: versions.toml [rid.*] 没有 category = desktop 的 RID"); return 1; }
    int i = 0;
    while (i < rids.Length) {
        string rid = rids[i];
        string ar = Path.Join(distDir, _desktopPieceName(label, rid));
        if (!File.Exists(ar)) {
            ConsoleError.WriteLine("assemble-desktop-workload: missing piece for " + rid + " (" + Path.GetFileName(ar) + ")");
            return 1;
        }
        string tmp = Path.Join(work, "x-" + rid);
        Directory.Create(tmp);
        int xc;
        if (ar.EndsWith(".zip")) { xc = _exec(new Process("unzip").Arg("-q").Arg(ar).Arg("-d").Arg(tmp)); }
        else { xc = _exec(new Process("tar").Arg("-xzf").Arg(ar).Arg("-C").Arg(tmp)); }
        if (xc != 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("extract failed: " + ar); return 1; }
        string[] hosts = Path.Glob(tmp, "apphost-" + rid + "*");
        int h = 0;
        while (h < hosts.Length) {
            File.Copy(hosts[h], Path.Join(merged, Path.GetFileName(hosts[h])));
            h = h + 1;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }

    File.WriteAllText(Path.Join(merged, "manifest.toml"),
        "[package]\n"
        + "name        = \"z42-workload-desktop\"\n"
        + "kind        = \"workload-tooling\"\n"
        + "version     = \"" + label + "\"\n"
        + "abi-version = 1\n"
        + "[contents.platform]\n"
        + "apphost-prefix = \"apphost-\"\n"
        + "host           = [\"*\"]\n"
        + "runtime-pack   = \"\"\n"
        + "[compat]\n"
        + "host-min-version = \"" + label + "\"\n");

    // remove per-RID intermediates (NOT the merged output — no trailing -rid)
    _deleteGlob(distDir, "z42-workload-" + label + "-desktop-*.tar.gz");
    _deleteGlob(distDir, "z42-workload-" + label + "-desktop-*.zip");

    string outTar = Path.Join(distDir, _wlArchiveName(label, "desktop"));
    int tc = _exec(_relTar(merged, outTar));
    if (tc != 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("tar failed: " + outTar); return 1; }
    Directory.Delete(work, true);
    Console.WriteLine("✓ merged desktop workload → " + Path.GetFileName(outTar));
    _procEnd("release assemble-desktop-workload", sw);
    return 0;
}

void _deleteGlob(string dir, string pattern) {
    string[] hits = Path.Glob(dir, pattern);
    int i = 0;
    while (i < hits.Length) { File.Delete(hits[i]); i = i + 1; }
}

// `package release` 第三步：generate <dist>/release-index.json from <dist>/SHA256SUMS — the launcher's supply
// contract (`z42 workload install` / runtime resolution read it, see src/toolchain/launcher/core/launcher_network.z42;
// the install scripts only consume SHA256SUMS). Shared by release.yml (tagged) and ci.yml publish-nightly
// (rolling), so the schema lives in ONE place.
int _releaseGenIndex(string label, string dist, string channel, string tag, string version) {
    Stopwatch sw = _procStart("release gen-release-index");
    if (channel.Length == 0) { channel = "stable"; }
    if (tag.Length == 0)     { tag = "v" + label; }
    if (version.Length == 0) { version = label; }
    string root = _root();
    string distDir = Path.IsRooted(dist) ? dist : Path.Join(root, dist);
    string sumsPath = Path.Join(distDir, "SHA256SUMS");
    if (!File.Exists(sumsPath)) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("error: missing " + sumsPath); return 1; }
    string sums = File.ReadAllText(sumsPath);
    string ts = _utcNow();

    // RID / workload 清单：versions.toml [rid.*] / [workload].members（desktop RID 出 sdk+runtime，
    // 其余出 runtime；workload 归档另加 release 专用的 `test` 伪 workload——测试 bundle 的归档名，不是平台）。
    string[] dRids = _vRidsOfCategory(root, "desktop");
    string[] allRids = _vRidNames(root);
    string[] pRids = new string[allRids.Length];
    int pn = 0;
    int pi = 0;
    while (pi < allRids.Length) {
        if (_vRidCategory(root, allRids[pi]) != "desktop") { pRids[pn] = allRids[pi]; pn = pn + 1; }
        pi = pi + 1;
    }
    string[] pRidsTight = new string[pn];
    int pk = 0;
    while (pk < pn) { pRidsTight[pk] = pRids[pk]; pk = pk + 1; }
    pRids = pRidsTight;
    string[] wlMembers = _vWorkloads(root);
    string[] wls = new string[wlMembers.Length + 1];
    int wn = 0;
    while (wn < wlMembers.Length) { wls[wn] = wlMembers[wn]; wn = wn + 1; }
    wls[wn] = "test";

    // ── validate: every required archive has a sha in SHA256SUMS ──
    int missing = 0;
    int i = 0;
    while (i < dRids.Length) {
        if (_shaOf(sums, _sdkName(label, dRids[i])).Length == 0)     { ConsoleError.WriteLine("release-index: missing sha for " + _sdkName(label, dRids[i])); missing = missing + 1; }
        if (_shaOf(sums, _rtName(label, dRids[i])).Length == 0)      { ConsoleError.WriteLine("release-index: missing sha for " + _rtName(label, dRids[i])); missing = missing + 1; }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    i = 0;
    while (i < pRids.Length) {
        if (_shaOf(sums, _rtName(label, pRids[i])).Length == 0)      { ConsoleError.WriteLine("release-index: missing sha for " + _rtName(label, pRids[i])); missing = missing + 1; }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    i = 0;
    while (i < wls.Length) {
        if (_shaOf(sums, _wlArchiveName(label, wls[i])).Length == 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("release-index: missing sha for workload " + wls[i]); missing = missing + 1; }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    if (missing > 0) { return 1; }

    // ── build the index JSON ──
    JsonValue runtimes = JsonValue.OfObject();
    i = 0;
    while (i < dRids.Length) {
        string rid = dRids[i];
        JsonValue e = JsonValue.OfObject();
        e.Set("sdk",     _jArch(_sdkName(label, rid), _shaOf(sums, _sdkName(label, rid))));
        e.Set("runtime", _jArch(_rtName(label, rid),  _shaOf(sums, _rtName(label, rid))));
        runtimes.Set(rid, e);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    i = 0;
    while (i < pRids.Length) {
        string rid = pRids[i];
        JsonValue e = JsonValue.OfObject();
        e.Set("runtime", _jArch(_rtName(label, rid), _shaOf(sums, _rtName(label, rid))));
        runtimes.Set(rid, e);
        i = i + 1;
    }

    JsonValue workloads = JsonValue.OfObject();
    workloads.Set("ios",     _jWorkload(label, sums, "ios",     _strArr1("macos-arm64"),                                       _strArr2("ios-arm64", "iossim-arm64")));
    workloads.Set("android", _jWorkload(label, sums, "android", _strArr4("macos-arm64", "linux-x64", "linux-arm64", "windows-x64"), _strArr2("android-arm64", "android-x64")));
    workloads.Set("wasm",    _jWorkload(label, sums, "wasm",    _strArr1("*"),                                                 _strArr1("browser-wasm")));
    workloads.Set("desktop", _jWorkload(label, sums, "desktop", _strArr1("*"),                                                 JsonValue.OfArray()));
    workloads.Set("test",    _jWorkload(label, sums, "test",    _strArr1("*"),                                                 JsonValue.OfArray()));

    JsonValue idx = JsonValue.OfObject();
    idx.Set("schema",    JsonValue.OfLong(1L));
    idx.Set("version",   JsonValue.OfString(version));
    idx.Set("channel",   JsonValue.OfString(channel));
    idx.Set("tag",       JsonValue.OfString(tag));
    idx.Set("published", JsonValue.OfString(ts));
    idx.Set("runtimes",  runtimes);
    idx.Set("workloads", workloads);

    string outPath = Path.Join(distDir, "release-index.json");
    File.WriteAllText(outPath, JsonValue.StringifyPretty(idx));
    Console.WriteLine("✓ wrote " + outPath);
    _procEnd("release gen-release-index", sw);
    return 0;
}

// ── 归档命名（唯一出处：release-index、`--archive`、桌面 workload 合并都从这里取名）──────────────
// 扩展名由 RID 的平台决定：Windows RID（versions.toml 的 triple 含 `windows`）出 `.zip`，其余 `.tar.gz`。
string _relArchiveExt(string rid) { return _vRidTriple(_root(), rid).Contains("windows") ? ".zip" : ".tar.gz"; }
string _sdkName(string label, string rid)          { return "z42-sdk-"      + label + "-" + rid + _relArchiveExt(rid); }
string _rtName(string label, string rid)           { return "z42-runtime-"  + label + "-" + rid + _relArchiveExt(rid); }
string _desktopPieceName(string label, string rid) { return "z42-workload-" + label + "-desktop-" + rid + _relArchiveExt(rid); }
// 平台 workload（主 RID 出）/ 合并后的桌面 workload / test workload：不随宿主平台变，恒 `.tar.gz`。
string _wlArchiveName(string label, string wl)     { return "z42-workload-" + label + "-" + wl + ".tar.gz"; }

// first non-empty token of the SHA256SUMS line whose last token == archive.
string _shaOf(string sums, string archive) {
    string[] lines = sums.Split("\n");
    int i = 0;
    while (i < lines.Length) {
        string ln = lines[i].Trim();
        if (ln.Length > 0) {
            string[] parts = ln.Split(" ");
            string name = "";
            int k = parts.Length - 1;
            while (k >= 0) { if (parts[k].Length > 0) { name = parts[k]; break; } k = k - 1; }
            if (name == archive) { return parts[0]; }
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return "";
}

JsonValue _jArch(string archive, string sha) {
    JsonValue o = JsonValue.OfObject();
    o.Set("archive", JsonValue.OfString(archive));
    o.Set("sha256",  JsonValue.OfString(sha));
    return o;
}
JsonValue _jWorkload(string label, string sums, string name, JsonValue host, JsonValue rts) {
    string archive = _wlArchiveName(label, name);
    JsonValue o = JsonValue.OfObject();
    o.Set("archive",  JsonValue.OfString(archive));
    o.Set("sha256",   JsonValue.OfString(_shaOf(sums, archive)));
    o.Set("host",     host);
    o.Set("runtimes", rts);
    return o;
}
JsonValue _strArr1(string a) { JsonValue r = JsonValue.OfArray(); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(a)); return r; }
JsonValue _strArr2(string a, string b) { JsonValue r = JsonValue.OfArray(); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(a)); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(b)); return r; }
JsonValue _strArr4(string a, string b, string c, string d) { JsonValue r = JsonValue.OfArray(); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(a)); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(b)); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(c)); r.Add(JsonValue.OfString(d)); return r; }

// ── `--archive` / `xtask package release` ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// 命名规则只在这里写一次：
//   · `--archive` 在**产出包的那台机器**上（upload-artifact 不保留可执行位，集中打包会丢）、随打包命令一起出（可执行位原样进 tar；Windows 包出真 zip），本地发布同一条命令；
//   · `release` 在汇总 job 上跑：合并桌面 workload → SHA256SUMS → release-index.json。
//
// 包目录（release profile）→ 归档名（`<L>` = label：版本号或 `nightly`；映射在 `_relArchiveName`）：
//   z42-<v>-<rid>-release            桌面 RID → z42-sdk-<L>-<rid>；平台 RID 只由主 RID 出 → z42-workload-<L>-<wl>
//   z42-runtime-<v>-<rid>            → z42-runtime-<L>-<rid>
//   z42-workload-<v>-desktop-<rid>   → z42-workload-<L>-desktop-<rid>（release 合并成一份）
//   z42-workload-<v>-test            → z42-workload-<L>-test
// 扩展名：Windows RID 的 sdk / runtime / desktop 零件出 `.zip`，其余 `.tar.gz`——规则只在 `_relArchiveExt` 一处
// （按 versions.toml 的 triple 判定）；release-index 用的 `_sdkName` / `_rtName` 与 `--archive` 出的名字同源。

// RID 清单 / 类别 / 主 RID：versions.toml `[rid.*]` 的唯一登记（加 RID = 改 toml，这里自动跟上）。
string[] _relRids() {
    return _vRidNames(_root());
}

bool _relIsDesktop(string rid) {
    return _ridCategory(rid) == "desktop";
}

// 平台 workload 的 tooling 包各 ABI / slice 内容相同 ⇒ 每个平台只由一个主 RID 出归档（否则汇总时同名相撞）。
string _relPrimaryWorkload(string rid) {
    string cat = _ridCategory(rid);
    if (cat == "desktop" || cat == "unknown") { return ""; }
    return _vRidPrimary(_root(), rid) ? cat : "";
}

// 包目录名 → 归档文件名（含扩展名）；不是要发布的包 → ""。
string _relArchiveName(string dirName, string ver, string label) {
    if (dirName == "z42-workload-" + ver + "-test") { return _wlArchiveName(label, "test"); }
    string[] rids = _relRids();
    int i = 0;
    while (i < rids.Length) {
        string rid = rids[i];
        if (dirName == "z42-" + ver + "-" + rid + "-release") {
            if (_relIsDesktop(rid)) { return _sdkName(label, rid); }
            string wl = _relPrimaryWorkload(rid);
            return wl.Length > 0 ? _wlArchiveName(label, wl) : "";
        }
        if (dirName == "z42-runtime-" + ver + "-" + rid)           { return _rtName(label, rid); }
        if (dirName == "z42-workload-" + ver + "-desktop-" + rid)  { return _desktopPieceName(label, rid); }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return "";
}

// 本进程里各打包命令产出的包目录（`_pkgFinish` / 桌面与 test workload 登记）——`--archive` 在命令跑完后
// 把它们逐个出成归档。打包命令的产出目录名由各自的实现决定，登记比在命令层再推一遍名字少一份拷贝。
static class PackageOutputs {
    static string _dirs = "";
    public static void Note(string dir) {
        PackageOutputs._dirs = PackageOutputs._dirs.Length == 0 ? dir : PackageOutputs._dirs + "\n" + dir;
    }
    public static string[] All() {
        return PackageOutputs._dirs.Length == 0 ? new string[0] : PackageOutputs._dirs.Split("\n");
    }
}

// `package sdk|runtime|workload --archive [--label L]`：本次产出的每个包目录 → 同目录下的发布归档
// （artifacts/packages/<基名>.tar.gz|.zip；归档名自带平台 / 架构，与包目录并排不会撞）。不是发布包的
// （非主 RID 的平台 tooling 包）说明后跳过。label 缺省 = versions.toml 的版本号（CI nightly 传 `nightly`）。
int _pkgArchiveOutputs(string label) {
    string root = _root();
    string ver = _versionsGet(root);
    if (ver.Length == 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("--archive: versions.toml 没有 [project].version"); return 1; }
    if (label.Length == 0) { label = ver; }
    foreach (var dir in PackageOutputs.All()) {
        if (_pkgArchiveDir(dir, ver, label, Path.GetDirectoryName(dir)) < 0) { return 1; }
    }
    return 0;
}

// 一个包目录 → <outDir>/<归档基名><ext>。返回 1 = 出了归档，0 = 不是要发布的包（跳过），-1 = 打包失败。
int _pkgArchiveDir(string dir, string ver, string label, string outDir) {
    string name = Path.GetFileName(dir);
    string arName = _relArchiveName(name, ver, label);
    if (arName.Length == 0) {
        Console.WriteLine("- " + name + "：不是要发布的包（平台 tooling 只由主 RID 出归档），不出归档");
        return 0;
    }
    string ar = Path.Join(outDir, arName);
    if (File.Exists(ar)) { File.Delete(ar); }
    int rc = ar.EndsWith(".zip") ? _relZipDir(dir, ar) : _exec(_relTar(dir, ar));
    if (rc != 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("--archive: 打包失败 " + ar); return -1; }
    Console.WriteLine("✓ " + name + " → " + Path.GetFileName(ar));
    return 1;
}

// 目录内容（不含目录本身）→ tar.gz。macOS 的 bsdtar 默认把本机扩展属性（com.apple.provenance 等）写成 pax 扩展头、
// 再加 AppleDouble `._*` 伴生文件——发布归档不该带这些：关掉它们。
Process _relTar(string dir, string ar) {
    Process p = new Process("tar").Arg("-C").Arg(dir);
    if (Platform.IsMacOS()) { p = p.Env("COPYFILE_DISABLE", "1").Arg("--no-xattrs").Arg("--no-mac-metadata"); }
    return p.Arg("-czf").Arg(ar).Arg(".");
}

// 目录内容（不含目录本身）→ zip。Windows 上用 .NET 的 ZipFile（条目分隔符是 `/`；Windows PowerShell 5.1 的
// Compress-Archive 会写出 `\`，Linux 上 unzip 要告警并以非零退出）；其它主机用 `zip`。
int _relZipDir(string dir, string zipPath) {
    if (Platform.IsWindows()) {
        string ps = "Add-Type -AssemblyName System.IO.Compression.FileSystem; "
            + "[System.IO.Compression.ZipFile]::CreateFromDirectory('" + dir.Replace("'", "''") + "', '"
            + zipPath.Replace("'", "''") + "')";
        return _exec(new Process("powershell").Arg("-NoProfile").Arg("-Command").Arg(ps));
    }
    return _execIn(new Process("zip").Arg("-qr").Arg(zipPath).Arg("."), dir);   // `_exec` 会把 cwd 强制成仓库根
}

// `xtask package release <label> [--dir DIR] [--channel C] [--tag T] [--version V]`
// 汇总 job 的全部 z42 侧步骤：合并桌面 workload → SHA256SUMS → release-index.json。要求全部 RID 的归档齐全
// （index 的校验会逐个点名缺的）。channel / tag / version 缺省 stable / v<label> / <label>。
// DIR 缺省 = artifacts/packages（`--archive` 出归档的地方；SHA256SUMS 只认 `z42-*.tar.gz|zip` 文件，包目录不干扰）。
int _packageRelease(string label, string dist, string channel, string tag, string version) {
    string root = _root();
    if (dist.Length == 0) { dist = _packagesDir(root); }
    string distDir = Path.IsRooted(dist) ? dist : Path.Join(root, dist);
    int rc = _releaseAssembleDesktop(label, distDir);
    if (rc != 0) { return rc; }
    rc = _releaseWriteSums(distDir);
    if (rc != 0) { return rc; }
    return _releaseGenIndex(label, distDir, channel, tag, version);
}

// <dist>/SHA256SUMS：`<sha>  <name>`，按文件名排序（与 `shasum -a 256 … | sort -k2` 同形）。
// 摘要走系统工具：Std.Crypto.Sha256 是纯脚本实现，解释模式下对几百 MB 的归档太慢。
int _releaseWriteSums(string distDir) {
    string[] tgz = Path.Glob(distDir, "z42-*.tar.gz");
    string[] zips = Path.Glob(distDir, "z42-*.zip");
    string[] names = new string[tgz.Length + zips.Length];
    int i = 0;
    while (i < tgz.Length) { names[i] = Path.GetFileName(tgz[i]); i = i + 1; }
    int j = 0;
    while (j < zips.Length) { names[tgz.Length + j] = Path.GetFileName(zips[j]); j = j + 1; }
    names = _sortedStrings(names);
    if (names.Length == 0) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("SHA256SUMS: " + distDir + " 下没有归档"); return 1; }
    string outp = "";
    i = 0;
    while (i < names.Length) {
        string sha = _sha256Hex(Path.Join(distDir, names[i]));
        if (sha.Length != 64) { ConsoleError.WriteLine("SHA256SUMS: 算不出 " + names[i] + " 的 sha256"); return 1; }
        outp = outp + sha + "  " + names[i] + "\n";
        i = i + 1;
    }
    File.WriteAllText(Path.Join(distDir, "SHA256SUMS"), outp);
    Console.WriteLine("✓ SHA256SUMS (" + names.Length.ToString() + " archives)");
    return 0;
}

